  "excursions": {
   "title": "Excursions",
   "kind": "facility",
   "items": [
    {
     "name": "Submarine Dive",
     "descriptionHtml": "<p>Imagine yourself cruising through an underwater garden filled with tropical fish. This is exactly what you will experience during your 45-minute dive. Onboard thewhale submarine you will descend to a submerged reef 45 meters beneath thesurface. During the Descent the seabed and different types of reef fish. In most ofthe dives, the submarine is greeted by a school of blue or yellow-striped snappers</p>",
     "image": "assets/img/836f23cc-0fa6-4f8d-82ad-97cea5909c87-f4c8ef5c86d55f97bc5c-4a7297.jpg",
     "video": "assets/video/Submarine-ca6824a8d8824458e67f-109fb8ee6e5acb2286dd4-029012.mp4",
     "qr": "",
     "qrCaption": "",
     "detailsLabel": "View Details",
     "details": []
    },
    {
     "name": "Daily Dives",
     "descriptionHtml": "<p>Some of the region's finest marine life and vibrant dive sites are just a short boat ride away. To ensure a seamless adventure, we partner with premier local dive professionals to offer exceptional daily excursions.</p><p>Excursion Rates (Per Person / Per Dive):</p><p>•\tWith Full Equipment Rental: $90</p><p>•\tWithout Equipment: $80</p><p>Please stop by or contact the Reception to view the current schedule, check weather conditions, and let us manage your entire booking.</p>",
     "image": "assets/img/25ec3697-6e6d-402d-a470-9661197dac5a-e74bc25f3e2cdf562ba1-5ecd22.jpg",
     "video": "assets/video/Daily-Dives-new--866abeccb5f268e7f646-73346fb91d48d6fd8fb8-28204e.mp4",
     "qr": "",
     "qrCaption": "",
     "detailsLabel": "View Details",
     "details": []
    },
    {
     "name": "Dive Boat Snorkeling Adventure",
     "descriptionHtml": "<p>Departure: 08:30 AM | Duration: 3 Hours</p><p>An excellent, budget-friendly option for those who want to discover the beautiful reef tops of the Maldives. This excursion joins our daily dive trips, taking you to two distinct snorkeling locations to explore vibrant marine life from above.</p><p><br></p><p>•\tRate: $55 per person</p><p>•\tIncludes: Standard snorkeling gear &amp; life jacket</p>",
     "image": "assets/img/98b87382-d31e-4920-abb8-a2770ebe7c63-2b4ead110afab62b37ac1-7378a4.png",
     "video": "",
     "qr": "",
     "qrCaption": "",
     "detailsLabel": "View Details",
     "details": []
    },
    {
     "name": "Snorkeling Adventure",
     "descriptionHtml": "<p>Departure: 08:30 AM | Duration: 3 Hours</p><p>Glide across stunning shades of turquoise water and over pristine coral reefs. This dedicated snorkeling excursion takes you to three different exceptional spots, offering the chance to view diverse fish species and colorful coral ecosystems.</p><p>•\tRate (Minimum 2 Pax): $85 per person</p><p>•\tGroup Rate (Group of 4+): $70 per person</p><p>•\tIncludes: Standard snorkeling gear &amp; life jacket</p>",
     "image": "assets/img/3da98122-8809-471a-9e13-705c102a8378-717fc4ee646f63cbb979-00a3d2.png",
     "video": "",
     "qr": "",
     "qrCaption": "",
     "detailsLabel": "View Details",
     "details": []
    },
    {
     "name": "Snorkeling with Stingrays",
     "descriptionHtml": "<p>Departure: 09:00 AM | Duration: 3 Hours</p><p>Get up close and personal with majestic, friendly stingrays in their natural shallow-water habitat. Perfect for both swimmers and non-swimmers, this unique experience allows you to observe these beautiful creatures gliding along the ocean floor alongside other incredible local marine life.</p><p>•\tRate (Minimum 2 Pax): $95 per person</p><p>•\tGroup Rate (Group of 4+): $85 per person</p><p>•\tIncludes: Standard snorkeling gear &amp; life jacket</p>",
     "image": "assets/img/21ce4a51-a784-44f9-80d3-a82ca1d2381f-9ce9ef3d3b037e29afad-b6be07.png",
     "video": "",
     "qr": "",
     "qrCaption": "",
     "detailsLabel": "View Details",
     "details": []
    },
    {
     "name": "Sandbank Trip & Snorkeling",
     "descriptionHtml": "<p>Departure: 09:00 AM | Duration: 4 Hours</p><p>Escape the city with a scenic 30 to 45-minute boat ride to an isolated, pure white sandbank. Surrounded by breathtaking shades of turquoise water, this peaceful getaway offers the perfect private setting to stroll, sunbathe, swim, and snorkel at your leisure.</p><p>•\tRate (Minimum 2 Pax): $120 per person</p><p>•\tGroup Rate (Group of 4+): $80 per person</p><p>• Includes: Standard snorkeling gear &amp; life jacket<br></p>",
     "image": "assets/img/5682e1ed-6070-4743-955a-e2745f636042-c0b61aa91b8104ee7e4b4-4b7436.jpg",
     "video": "",
     "qr": "",
     "qrCaption": "",
     "detailsLabel": "View Details",
     "details": []
    },
    {
     "name": "Dolphin Sunset Cruise",
     "descriptionHtml": "<p>Departure: 04:00 PM | Duration: 3 Hours</p><p>Set sail in the late afternoon to encounter playful, fun-loving dolphins. Witness them gracefully swim and spin alongside the boat against the backdrop of a mesmerizing Maldivian sunset.</p><p>•\tRate (Minimum 2 Pax): $100 per person</p><p>•\tGroup Rate (Group of 4+): $80 per person</p><p>•\tIncludes: Soft drinks &amp; short-eats (traditional snacks)</p><p>•\tPlease Note: While dolphins are highly abundant in the area, sightings cannot be guaranteed on every trip.</p>",
     "image": "assets/img/e482aca4-2428-4638-8043-3baaef6595b5-0ac965950b9db0066f6f-fb47ae.jpg",
     "video": "",
     "qr": "",
     "qrCaption": "",
     "detailsLabel": "View Details",
     "details": []
    },
    {
     "name": "Snorkeling, Dolphins, Fishing & BBQ",
     "descriptionHtml": "<p>Departure: 02:30 PM | Duration: 5 Hours</p><p>The ultimate Maldivian experience packed into one incredible afternoon. Enjoy a customizable boat journey featuring scenic snorkeling stops, a thrilling cruise to see resident dolphin pods, and a traditional evening fishing session.</p><p>•\tRate (Minimum 2 Pax): $135 per person</p><p>•\tGroup Rate (Group of 4+): $115 per person</p><p>•\tIncludes: Snorkeling gear, fishing gear, bait, life jacket &amp; barbecue </p><p><br></p>",
     "image": "assets/img/e4885e8f-727d-4ab9-83b6-826925725852-2d9a522cd9e3cd6fe7a0-f9a202.jpg",
     "video": "",
     "qr": "",
     "qrCaption": "",
     "detailsLabel": "View Details",
     "details": []
    },
    {
     "name": "Dolphin Watching, Fishing & BBQ",
     "descriptionHtml": "<p>Departure: 04:00 PM | Duration: 4 Hours</p><p>Watch playful dolphins spin through the waves as you head out to a tranquil night-fishing spot. Cast a line under the starry night sky and enjoy the peaceful stillness of the ocean. Your evening concludes with a delicious barbecue featuring the fresh catch of the night.</p><p>•\tRate (Minimum 2 Pax): $120 per person</p><p>•\tGroup Rate (Group of 4+): $95 per person</p><p>•\tIncludes: Fishing gear, bait &amp; barbecue dinner</p><p><br></p>",
     "image": "assets/img/f542ab73-bb53-4ae0-99bc-5df8ef7ae6c0-f89af1f05856e4302a79-b9ebea.jpg",
     "video": "",
     "qr": "",
     "qrCaption": "",
